# AGENTS.md

## How to invoke agents

### VS Code (GitHub Copilot Chat)
Type `@<agentname>` in Copilot Chat — e.g. `@__COORDINATOR_ROLE__ route this task`.
Or open the agent picker dropdown and select from the list.

### Claude Code
Claude Code reads `CLAUDE.md` automatically at session start. The `## Agent Context` section summarises the roster and handoffs. Read `AGENTS.md` for full details.

### Cursor
Agents apply via globs — open a file matching the agent's glob pattern and it activates.

### Codex
Codex reads this file natively — there is no roster file to register and no activation prefix.
Starting at the Git root it walks down to your working directory, taking at most one instruction
file per directory (`AGENTS.override.md` takes precedence over `AGENTS.md`) and concatenating
them root-first, so a deeper file overrides a shallower one. The combined size is capped by
`project_doc_max_bytes` (32 KiB by default).

